{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: LLM基础MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LoRA 和 QLoRA 的原理是什么？如何选择微调方案？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LLM基础与Prompt工程\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/LLM基础\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LoRA 和 QLoRA 的原理是什么？如何选择微调方案？\" dir=\"auto\">LoRA 和 QLoRA 的原理是什么？如何选择微调方案？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LoRA 和 QLoRA 的原理是什么？它们的区别是什么？在实际项目中如何选择？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、LoRA（Low-Rank Adaptation）原理</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">核心思想：冻结预训练权重 W，只训练低秩分解矩阵 A 和 B。</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">原始权重更新: W' = W + ΔW\nLoRA 近似:     ΔW ≈ B × A\n\n其中: W ∈ R^(d×d), B ∈ R^(d×r), A ∈ R^(r×d), r &lt;&lt; d\n\n训练参数量从 d×d 降到 d×r + r×d = 2dr\n当 r=16, d=4096 时，仅需训练 0.8% 的参数\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nn <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> nn\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LoRALayer</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>nn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Module<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"LoRA 层实现\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> in_features<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> out_features<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> rank<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">16</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token builtin\">super</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>__init__<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rank <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> rank\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 冻结的预训练权重</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>weight <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> nn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Parameter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>zeros<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>out_features<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> in_features<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>weight<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>requires_grad <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 可训练的低秩矩阵</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lora_A <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> nn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Parameter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>randn<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>in_features<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> rank<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lora_B <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> nn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Parameter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>zeros<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>rank<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> out_features<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 缩放因子</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scaling <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.01</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">forward</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 原始输出 + LoRA 适配</span>\n        original <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>functional<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>linear<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>weight<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        lora_output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>functional<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>linear<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>functional<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>linear<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lora_A<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lora_B<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scaling\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> original <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> lora_output\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、QLoRA 相比 LoRA 多了什么</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">QLoRA = 4-bit 量化的基础模型 + LoRA 可训练适配器\n\n三个关键创新：\n1. NF4 量化（NormalFloat4）: 信息量最优的 4-bit 数据格式\n2. Double Quantization: 对量化缩放因子再做量化，进一步省显存\n3. Paged Optimizers: CPU 内存作为 GPU 显存扩展，自动换页\n\n效果：65B 模型在单张 48GB A100 上可以微调\n（不用 QLoRA 需要 4×80GB A100）\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、LoRA 配置建议</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># LoRA 配置最佳实践</span>\nLORA_CONFIG <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标层：注意力层的 Q/K/V/O 投影</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"target_modules\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"q_proj\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"k_proj\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"v_proj\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"o_proj\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># Rank 选择</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"rank\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">16</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>        <span class=\"token comment\"># 数据少/任务简单: r=8; 数据多/任务复杂: r=32/64</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 缩放因子</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"alpha\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">32</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>       <span class=\"token comment\"># 通常 alpha = 2 * rank</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># Dropout</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"dropout\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.05</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 防止过拟合</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 学习率</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"learning_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">2e-4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># LoRA 通常用较大学习率</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 效果：只训练 0.1%-1% 的参数，达到全量微调 95%+ 的效果</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、选择建议</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 充足（A100 80G × 4）</td>\n<td>全量微调</td>\n<td>效果最好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 有限（A100 40G × 1）</td>\n<td>LoRA</td>\n<td>训练稳定，效果不错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 极少（消费级显卡）</td>\n<td>QLoRA</td>\n<td>单卡微调大模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速实验/迭代</td>\n<td>LoRA</td>\n<td>训练速度快，checkpoint 小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"LoRA 应该加在哪些层？\"</strong> — 主要是 Q/K/V/O 注意力投影层，有时加 FFN 层。实验证明只对 Q 和 V 加效果也很好</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"Rank 越大越好吗？\"</strong> — 不是。r 太大容易过拟合，数据少时 r=8 就够</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}